Today I learned about the Tuple- Its is a order collection of data items.They are stored multiple items in a single variable.Tuple can not change as the list change.
ex-
tup=(1,3,125,28,45)
tup[1]=7
print(tup)
In this code error will show because of tuple.If we want changes in above code then we will change tuple into list,
then the code will executed..
correct code is -
t=(1,3,125,28,45)
temp=list(t)
temp[1]=7
temp=tuple(temp)
print(temp)
output is-
(1,7,125,28,45)
Explanation-
3 will replace by 7 because of temp[1]=7 line means first position element is replace by 7.


